        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420-a2-a1">

                <pb facs="0421" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg401"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Court of the United States, Consulate
                                General,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Shanghai,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 25, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>John D. Buckley stands charged with having, on the evening of the 22d day of May,
                    1863, wilfully and maliciously, and without provocation, caused the death of one
                    Captain John McKennon, against the peace of the people of the United States.</p>
            </div>
